  "@type": "AnalogicalMapping",
  "instance_name": "mapping_1",
  "label": "Textual command mapped onto visual gesture",
  "description": "The text 'you see that?? it means get the fuck back to the kitchen' is mapped onto the visual of the man pointing at the woman. The man's pointing gesture and stern expression are interpreted as embodying the command implied by the text, which enforces the misogynistic stereotype that women belong in the kitchen. The visual action (pointing) is analogically mapped to the textual command (get back to the kitchen).",
